# --- Derived data ----------------------------------------------------------
# output/ holds ~150 MB of intermediates. Only the files the paper's figure
# scripts actually read are committed, and they are force-added so that this
# blanket ignore cannot silently drop them again. Run `make check-data` (or
# scripts/check_required_data.py) to verify the committed set still covers
# every path referenced by a figure script.
output/*
!output/.gitkeep

# Regenerable image formats. The manuscript \includegraphics only PDFs (32 of
# them); the PNG/SVG siblings are build products of the same scripts. Note that
# .gitignore does not untrack anything: the 50 PNGs already in the repo stay
# tracked and keep showing modifications. This only stops *new* ones from
# accumulating as untracked noise. Drop these two lines if the PNGs are wanted
# for slides or a README.
figures/*.png
figures/*.svg

# --- Internal review artifacts ---------------------------------------------
coauthor_diff.tex
dif.tex
diff.tex
old.tex
